    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d551">

                <pb facs="0918" n="798" sameAs="frus:frus1932v01/pg798"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.51W89 Lithuania/94</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Lithuanian Minister (Balutis) to the Secretary of
                            State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-12-15">December 15,
                        1932</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my note and Memorandum
                    delivered to you on December 10, and the exchange of views on that occasion, I
                    have the honor to inform you that the Lithuanian Government has decided to pay
                    the next instalment due to the Treasury of the United States on December 15, as
                    provided by the terms of the Debt Funding Agreement of September 22, 1924, and
                    that the said payment will be made to the Secretary of the Treasury of the
                    United States.</p>
                <p>At the same time my Government desires to express a hope that by making this
                    payment it is not placing itself in a less favorable <pb facs="0919" n="799"
                        xml:id="pg799"/> position than that which may result to any of the other
                    countries from the eventual reconsideration of the general question of
                    intergovernmental debts.</p>
                <p>Please accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bronius K. Balutis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
